### 
Subproofs:
    A test for non-nested subproofs

Dependencies: AND_INTRO
###

GIVEN A 
GIVEN B
DERIVE A AND B

ASSUME C                  # push(C)
    APPLY AND_INTRO A, C  # yield A && C
END                       # pop(C)

ASSUME C                  # push(C)
    APPLY AND_INTRO B, C  # yield B && C
END                       # pop(C)

APPLY AND_INTRO A, B      # yield A && B

CONCLUDE